From: Christopher Stenger <chris.h.stenger@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: h713: put the kernel console on the panel too

The panel has been able to show the kernel console since the AFBD driver
landed -- fbcon binds to it, `/sys/class/vtconsole/vtcon1` reports "frame
buffer device" bound -- and nothing has ever been printed there, because the
command line names only the serial port:

    console=ttyS0,115200 earlycon ...

so printk goes to UART0 and the panel shows whatever U-Boot left behind.
Adding console=tty0 registers the virtual console as a second printk
destination. Serial stays first and stays the default for a bare `console=`
consumer, so nothing that currently reads the UART changes.

When a console registers late the kernel replays the log buffer to it, so the
panel shows the boot from the beginning rather than from the moment the
display driver probed -- which is 6.2 s in, well after the interesting part.

This is half of what is needed. The other half is U-Boot bringing the panel up
before Linux starts: the driver adopts a running framebuffer and refuses to
probe otherwise, so without that the console has nowhere to go. See
CONFIG_PREBOOT in the board defconfig.

Both boards get it; the two command lines differ in other respects already.

Signed-off-by: Christopher Stenger <chris.h.stenger@gmail.com>
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713-hy200-qz713df-a1.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713-hy200-qz713df-a1.dts
@@ -7,7 +7,7 @@
 	compatible = "cstenger,hy200-qz713df-a1", "allwinner,sun50i-h713";
 
 	chosen {
-		bootargs = "console=ttyS0,115200 earlycon root=/dev/mmcblk0p26 rootwait rootfstype=ext4 rw net.ifnames=0 panic=5 clk_ignore_unused pd_ignore_unused cma=128M";
+		bootargs = "console=ttyS0,115200 console=tty0 earlycon root=/dev/mmcblk0p26 rootwait rootfstype=ext4 rw net.ifnames=0 panic=5 clk_ignore_unused pd_ignore_unused cma=128M";
 	};
 };
 
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713-hy200-qz713-v2.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713-hy200-qz713-v2.dts
@@ -7,6 +7,6 @@
 	compatible = "cstenger,hy200-qz713-v2", "allwinner,sun50i-h713";
 
 	chosen {
-		bootargs = "console=ttyS0,115200 earlycon root=/dev/mmcblk0p26 rootwait rootfstype=ext4 net.ifnames=0 panic=5 clk_ignore_unused pd_ignore_unused hy310_board_mgr.no_rpm_shutdown=1 cma=128M";
+		bootargs = "console=ttyS0,115200 console=tty0 earlycon root=/dev/mmcblk0p26 rootwait rootfstype=ext4 net.ifnames=0 panic=5 clk_ignore_unused pd_ignore_unused hy310_board_mgr.no_rpm_shutdown=1 cma=128M";
 	};
 };
